sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics, and (Pass 3) 3D multi-layered L1/L2/L3 Voronoi cell mesh with dynamic division planes faithfully reproduces Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis, L2/L3 corpus & floral primordia) morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis, L2/L3 corpus & floral primordia) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 86.9/100, audit 2026-10-19-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-audit-v3) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py; output: docs/media/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics_comparison.png; organism: Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis, L2/L3 corpus & floral primordia); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/d58a084; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, matplotlib 3.10.7, Pillow 12.0.0; spec_fingerprint: bc94b13a6b26f42aa1073ace658e06dfd3f2592d5212c5761812f7f46fad2b02; artifact_sha256: c36d8725eaa507fe05e4763c5e0e521e0b417c0c4ac585a68e02d6ebdf649328; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/arabidopsis_sam_meristem_specimen.jpg=3a8b54b71f7c780c..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics_reference.json=d412b9c3432a07ad..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/paper_citations.bib=5abefe46e9337a7e..., datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem_mechanics/scout_manifest.json=1c17f6d448f3c423...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-audit-v2; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Hamant et al. (2008) Science 322:1650-1655 pressurized shell principal tensile stress tensor across spherical dome (sigma_theta = sigma_m = PR/2t), cylindrical flank (sigma_theta = 2*sigma_z = PR/t), and negative-Gaussian-curvature primordium boundary saddle crease, driving cortical microtubule (CMT) alignment and anisotropic Lockhart wall yielding | Heisler et al. (2010) PLoS Biol 8:e1000516 co-alignment between PIN1 auxin efflux carrier polarity and CMT orientation across L1 meristem cells (84.5% within +-30 deg) and synchronous circumferential reorientation following single-cell laser ablation | Louveaux et al. (2016) PNAS 113:E4294 shoot-apex division planes follow maximal tensile stress; 65-77% of planes are the shortest plane and 81% of divisions are symmetric (smaller daughter 40-50%); Reddy et al. (2004) L1/L2 divide anticlinally, corpus periclinally and anticlinally; reconstructed_in_script: Doubly-curved thin-shell Laplace-Young principal stress solver across all 4 SAM curvature zones + Fokker-Planck CMT nematic order S_CMT(A_sigma) + transverse-isotropic Lockhart cell-wall yielding | 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome coupled Auxin-PIN1-CMT ODE simulator with the L1 stress field supplied by the 3D mesh (Pass 3) or by the Pass 2 analytic field (ablation); antisymmetric active flux conservation; 137.06 deg golden-angle phyllotaxis | Pass 3: 526-cell four-sheet L1/L2/L3a/L3b 3D Voronoi cell-centre mesh with wall springs, turgor on exterior faces, Jacobi-relaxed quasi-statics, per-cell virial tension tensor, Lockhart creep, division at volume doubling with Louveaux-2016 tension or Besson-Dumais-2011 Gibbs anticlinal planes (L1/L2) and 3D Gibbs planes (L3); L1 load share vs Lean Law 4; stiffness-ratio sweep | Kirsch circular laser-ablation wound stress redistribution (rim hoop stress doubling), lateral micro-vise compression, and 20 ug/mL oryzalin negative control; the post-ablation circumferential fraction is a fitted exponential relaxation, not a simulated reorientation | Automated segmentation of the Toluidine-Blue Arabidopsis SAM histological section (539 tunica-corpus nuclei, L1 dome contour & saddle crease) and apex-registered comparison of the mesh outer-L1 profile with the calibrated specimen contour; transfer_boundary: Axisymmetric/saddle thin-shell stress laws, 168-cell paraboloidal L1 dome and the 3D paraboloidal cell-centre mesh mapped to a single longitudinal histological SAM section; division-plane statistics compared with literature values (Louveaux 2016, Reddy 2004), not with the specimen; does_not_claim: A finite-element or vertex-model mechanical solution: the 3D mesh has cell-centre degrees of freedom only, no wall bending, no cell-volume constraint, stress-free insertion of new contacts, and does not reproduce the radial growth of the thin-shell anisotropy magnitude | That the 84.9% PIN1-CMT co-alignment, the 0.91 post-ablation circumferential fraction, the lateral-compression S_CMT or the 50 um calibrated dome radius are emergent model predictions (they are imposed by hard-coded noise/fit/fudge/calibration constants, see remediation)]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jplph.2007.08.002>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0509839103>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1011866108>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1600677113>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1165594>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.01261>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.1000516>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1002389> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-mirabet-auxin-pin1-meristem-mechanics-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.869"^^xsd:double .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "2008-hamant-meristem-microtubule-stress.py" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> ;
        schema:programmingLanguage "Python" ;
        schema:version "d58a084" .
}

